                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【Requests】[REQ CAP] - [REQ AUD] Apple Music NYE 2025 (DJ Mix) - Justice]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/req-aud-apple-music-nye-2025-dj-mix-justice.291965/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<b>Link</b>:<span style="color: #0000ff"> <a href="https://music.apple.com/us/album/nye-2025-dj-mix/1779812248" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">https://music.apple.com/us/album/nye-2025-dj-mix/1779812248</a></span><br>
Hello everyone, I’ve been searching for this Justice DJ Mix in high quality for quite some time, specifically in ALAC format. Since this mix is exclusive to Apple Music, it has been difficult to find rips that aren’t limited to AAC 256K or simple screen recordings. The mix includes unique versions of tracks from <i>Hyperdrama</i> and <i>Woman Worldwide</i> that are usually only performed live, as well as one track that has never been officially released outside of other DJ sets. I would greatly appreciate any help in locating a proper ALAC rip. Thank you in advance.
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
                <author><![CDATA[Tonyony]]></author>
                </item>

                
